### RECURSION ###

# Please complete the function to recursively compute 
whether the binary tree is symmetric 
# (i.e., the left subtree is the same as the right subtree)
# Parameters: root - TreeNode object of root node with fields: root.left, 
#                                                              root.right, 
#                                                              root.val
def is_symmetric(root) -> bool:
